cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ParaGUIBench in your research, please cite the preprint below."
title: "ParaGUIBench: Benchmarking Parallel Execution and Coordination for GUI Agents"
abstract: >-
  ParaGUIBench is a 233-task benchmark for planning, coordinating, and evaluating
  concurrent GUI work across browsers, desktops, and shared resources. It ships
  task contracts, deterministic evaluators, a run store, and reference agent
  systems for both sequential GUI-only and parallel ParaGUI execution.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/pkgunboat/ParaGUIBench"
version: "0.3.0.dev0"
date-released: "2026-08-24"
keywords:
  - GUI agent
  - benchmark
  - parallel execution
  - multi-agent coordination
  - large language model
